{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>機場停機坪有穿梭巴士行駛期間，六人失平衡跌倒，輕傷送院。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.TA.AIRPORT-0000.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20263mrJh0KhBE1794415196.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>六名乘客清醒，送到北大嶼山醫院治理，警方指周三晚十時許接報，指一輛穿梭巴士，接載下機乘客到客運大樓期間，六名乘客失平衡受傷。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.TA.AIRPORT-0000_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026260O0ka6t01794415166.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>機場航班運作沒有受影響。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T17:42:14.413621+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":104,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T16:35:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T02:00:40.782837+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T17:35:30.901643+00:00","content_hash":"b4bf2a480d528a963a46d551e3818c2634dfb7387dfca812f25887a90f95f70d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-11T17:42:14.413621+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}